I don't know.

23
00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:53.570
That sounded...

24
00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:53.970
Whatever.

25
00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:56.830
It's two weeks of Work Bus goodness.

26
00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:58.230
Because there's a lot to say.

27
00:00:58.330 --> 00:00:58.550
Yes.

28
00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:00.910
Let's start with a summary.

29
00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:02.530
It's a good place to start.

30
00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:03.190
Here it is.

31
00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:03.570
It always is.

32
