Jim tricks Dwight into believing the building is unsafe in order to give Pam a break.

34
00:01:09.870 --> 00:01:11.430
You know, Jim's feeling guilty.

35
00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:13.790
Pam's being so cool, so...

36
00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:15.130
Oh, I have a whole thing.

37
00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:16.170
I have a whole theory.

38
00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:16.830
Oh, you have a whole thing.

39
00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:17.210
Uh-huh.

40
