I'll save it.

41
00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:19.210
Go on with your fast fact.

42
00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.390
I was not going to rant about it this week.

43
00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.630
I was going to give everyone a break.

44
00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:24.910
Well, I did a little digging into...

45
00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:26.590
Anyway, I'm saving it.

46
00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:26.870
Go.

47
