Well, Jim's plan is thwarted when Dwight rents a bus for everyone to work from.

49
00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:41.530
Then Jim gets the bus moving with a promise of pie in an attempt to give Pam the best day ever.

50
00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:47.550
Nellie is going to seek a recommendation from Andy for an adoption application.

51
00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:55.330
If you had any feelings of goodwill toward Andy, they will be completely squashed today, I believe.

52
00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:56.210
Yeah.

53
00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.910
This episode makes him fairly unredeemable.

54
