And finally, Dwight has a heart-to-heart with Jim.

55
00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:09.610
This is very off-topic, but when you said thwarted, it sounded so funny.

56
00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:10.410
Why?

57
00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:11.290
I don't know.

58
00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:12.170
I juSt...

59
00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:12.470
Thwarted?

60
00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.630
I wasn't expecting you to say thwarted.

61
00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:19.030
It's not a word I throw out very often, and when you said it, I don't know, it got me tickled.

62
00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:20.330
It's one of my favorite words.

63
00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:20.930
Say it.

64
00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:21.530
Thwarted.

65
00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:23.010
I don't know.

66
