00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:21.940
Schadenfreude.

472
00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:22.660
Mm-hmm.

473
00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:25.440
It loosely translates as harm joy.

474
00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:26.560
Wow.

